{
  "id": "personal-work-dev-v1",
  "split": "development",
  "description": "Six synthetic calibration tasks; no holdout claims",
  "limits": {
    "model_calls": 12,
    "seconds": 180,
    "max_turns": 12,
    "sdk_retries": 0
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "DEV-DOC-01",
      "group": "office",
      "template_family": "supplier-quotes",
      "inputs": [
        "office/terms.pdf",
        "office/quotes.xlsx"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "读取office/terms.pdf和office/quotes.xlsx，比较方案A与B，输出report.docx与numbers.json。Word需写清两方案含税与不含税总价、首年较便宜方案、差额、来源页码/单元格、续约折扣是否已知。numbers.json只含A_ex_vat、B_ex_vat、A_inc_vat、B_inc_vat、first_year_choice、difference_inc_vat六个字段；数值自行根据材料计算，方案字段为A或B。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "word-structure",
          "kind": "structure",
          "path": "report.docx",
          "expected": null,
          "locator": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "totals",
          "kind": "json",
          "path": "numbers.json",
          "expected": {
            "A_ex_vat": 2160,
            "B_ex_vat": 2220,
            "A_inc_vat": 2289.6,
            "B_inc_vat": 2353.2,
            "first_year_choice": "A",
            "difference_inc_vat": 63.6
          },
          "locator": "terms.pdf p1; Quotes B2:D3"
        },
        {
          "id": "report-values",
          "kind": "contains",
          "path": "report.docx",
          "expected": [
            "2160",
            "2220",
            "2289.6",
            "2353.2",
            "63.6"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "关键数字必须与材料一致；正确说明首年与续约限制；来源定位可核查。DOCX版式需另行视觉验收。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-DOC-02",
      "group": "office",
      "template_family": "minutes-conflict",
      "inputs": [
        "office/minutes.docx",
        "office/draft.pptx"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "对比office/minutes.docx与office/draft.pptx，按最终确认记录整理brief.md，写明新旧日期/预算冲突、最终采用值、负责人、待办责任人和期限、未定事项与来源文件定位，不得把旧版方案写成最终决定。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "facts",
          "kind": "contains",
          "path": "brief.md",
          "expected": [
            "2026-11-12",
            "48000",
            "林舟",
            "陈默",
            "2026-10-30",
            "2026-11-05",
            "52000",
            "供应商"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "必须明确48000和11月12日为最终决定，52000和11月5日为旧方案；未定供应商不可编造。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-RES-01",
      "group": "research",
      "template_family": "effective-date-conflict",
      "inputs": [
        "research/v1.txt",
        "research/v2.txt",
        "research/summary.txt"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "今天固定为2026-10-25。仅根据research目录三个固定快照整理comparison.md，区分现行额度与已公布未生效额度，指出第三方摘要的冲突；每条事实附文件名和段落，文末参考资料表保留快照URI，不得访问真实网络或虚构新资料。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "version-facts",
          "kind": "contains",
          "path": "comparison.md",
          "expected": [
            "80",
            "120",
            "150",
            "2026-11-01",
            "v1.txt",
            "v2.txt",
            "summary.txt",
            "https://example.invalid/plans/2026-10"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "80为当前额度、120为11月1日起额度、150缺少证据；引用段落真实支持主张，文献表独立可用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-RES-02",
      "group": "research",
      "template_family": "insufficient-evidence",
      "inputs": [
        "research/missing.txt"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "根据research/missing.txt生成evidence.md：回答团队版价格、数据保存期限、是否支持导出，逐项区分已知/未知，给出资料定位和后续核验问题。不要猜测金额/期限，不需要向人提问。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "unknowns",
          "kind": "contains",
          "path": "evidence.md",
          "expected": [
            "价格",
            "期限",
            "未知",
            "导出",
            "missing.txt"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "no-invented-values",
          "kind": "not_contains",
          "path": "evidence.md",
          "expected": [
            "99元",
            "30天",
            "永久保存"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "价格和保存期限均应标未知；支持导出有来源；不能把例举的价格/期限当成真实信息。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-CTX-01",
      "group": "context",
      "template_family": "large-source-constraint",
      "inputs": [
        "context/notes.txt"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "本任务只写本地草稿，不得外发。请读取context/notes.txt，保留项目代号、金额上限、负责人和交付日，简短复述约束，稍后继续。",
        "继续刚才任务，不必再重复全文；输出state.json，仅包含project、budget、owner、due、external_write_allowed五个字段，按资料保留准确值。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "constraints",
          "kind": "json",
          "path": "state.json",
          "expected": {
            "project": "松鹤",
            "budget": 37600,
            "owner": "许青",
            "due": "2026-11-18",
            "external_write_allowed": false
          },
          "locator": "notes.txt opening and final paragraphs"
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "跨轮约束及负责人和日期一致；不得声称实际完成任何外部发布。本题只校准大结果外置，不证明压缩质量。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-WF-01",
      "group": "workflow",
      "template_family": "local-draft-preservation",
      "inputs": [
        "workflow/draft.md",
        "workflow/decision.txt"
      ],
      "turns": [
        "根据workflow/decision.txt修订workflow/draft.md，保存为updated.md，保留草稿状态与原金额，只补充风险说明。禁止覆盖原稿或对外发送，最后报告真实交付路径及状态。"
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "revision",
          "kind": "contains",
          "path": "updated.md",
          "expected": [
            "草稿",
            "9500",
            "供应商",
            "交付周期"
          ],
          "locator": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "original",
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "path": "workflow/draft.md",
          "expected": null,
          "locator": ""
        }
      ],
      "rubric": [
        {
          "id": "human-facts-and-usefulness",
          "criterion": "修改范围正确、金额不变、未冒充已发布，原稿保留。本题不替代真实调度或连接器验收。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
